title: $:/lithic/fonts/katex-numerals
type: text/css
tags: $:/tags/Stylesheet

/*
SUPERSEDED - kept only so older standalones that imported the previous
(per-font-face) numerals experiment drop its leftover rules.

This sheet used to register a separate "Mermaid Numerals" @font-face
(digits-only unicode-range) plus a body::after warm-up hack. The numerals
now live INSIDE the Vollkorn family itself: $:/lithic/fonts/vollkorn ships
a merged font (Vollkorn outlines + KaTeX-digit outlines, see
scripts/merge-vollkorn-digits.py), so digits render with the LaTeX look
everywhere with no extra face, no unicode-range, and no warm-up needed.
*/
